# Production build: same-origin `/api/*` when empty — firebase.json must rewrite `/api/**` to the Express Cloud Run service.
# If https://YOUR_SITE.web.app/api/health returns HTML, either fix firebase.json "serviceId" to match Cloud Run, OR set your
# API origin here (https only, no trailing slash). API must allow CORS_ORIGIN=https://circle-prospecting-ai.web.app
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
